The defect: `is_empty` answers true for one argument as well as for none, the off-by-one a
rewrite of the comparison as "at most one" would make.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(parsed.is_empty(), parsed.iter().next().is_none())`, on any page with
exactly one argument.

